### CITY-ITH social client pruning (2026-09-06)

Patch `0039` removes two unused client-side dependency paths: the Webaverse
microphone/speech subsystem (Discord is the Activity voice provider) and the
offscreen diorama character preview. The latter is no longer reachable from
the social HUD. The actual in-world avatar and its skins are not changed.
Bootstrap release `fw66-pilot-2026-09-06.40` awaits Discord regression QA.
